# Moddy Arena: nothing of a player's is taken away. In a battle he throws a block in the arena, and is knocked out
# with lives left wearing an iron chestplate: it falls where he fell, as Minecraft drops it. The arena mends itself
# when the wave is cleared, and his things still lie there for him to pick up; when the battle is over they are
# carried to the prep room, not cleared. Knocked out of his last life, the same: his things are in the prep room after
# the tidy. Monsters are removed by command; a resistance effect keeps them from knocking him out by themselves.
# play-timeout: 900
@intent a player's own dropped and thrown things survive the arena's mend between waves and its tidy at a battle's end, which carries them to the prep room, whether he was knocked out with lives left or out of his last life
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step he arrives
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 900 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 900 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy

@step in wave 1 he throws a block on the arena's far side
moddy arena start
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
teleport @s 0.5 64 -10.5 0 30
@wait 10t
item replace entity @s hotbar.8 with minecraft:cobblestone 5
@key key.hotbar.9
@wait 5t
@key key.drop
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:cobblestone"}}]

@step knocked out with lives left, his iron chestplate falls where he fell
teleport @s 8.5 64 -10.5 0 0
item replace entity @s armor.chest with minecraft:iron_chestplate
@wait 5t
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 2 lives left within 10s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:iron_chestplate"}}]
@assert execute unless items entity @s armor.chest minecraft:iron_chestplate
@wait 5s
@aim pos 8.5 64 -10.5
@wait 1s
@shot his-things-in-the-arena

@step the wave is cleared and the arena mended: his things still lie there
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:cobblestone"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:iron_chestplate"}}]

@step he stays away from them; the battle is won and his things are carried to the prep room
teleport @s -10.5 64 10.5 0 0
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 25s
@wait 1s
teleport @s -10.5 64 10.5 0 0
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title You won within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:iron_chestplate"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:iron_chestplate"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:cobblestone"}}]
teleport @s 0.5 64 24.5 180 40
@wait 1s
@shot his-things-in-the-prep-room

@step he picks them up where he comes back
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 2s
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:iron_chestplate

@step knocked out of his last life: his things are in the prep room after the tidy too
clear @s minecraft:iron_chestplate
moddy arena start
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
teleport @s 8.5 64 -10.5 0 0
item replace entity @s armor.chest with minecraft:golden_chestplate
@wait 5t
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 2 lives left within 10s
@wait 2s
teleport @s -10.5 64 10.5 0 0
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 1 life left within 10s
@wait 2s
teleport @s -10.5 64 10.5 0 0
kill @s
@expect chat no lives left within 10s
@wait 1s
teleport @s -10.5 64 10.5 0 0
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:golden_chestplate"}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:golden_chestplate"}}]
